{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09134","headline":"留别洛京亲友 · 韦应物","name":"留别洛京亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握手出都门，驾言适京师。\n岂不怀旧庐，惆怅与子辞。\n丽日坐高阁，清觞醼华池。\n昨游倏已过，後遇良未知。\n念结路方永，岁阴野无晖。\n单车我当前，暮雪子独归。\n临流一相望，零泪忽沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}